WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.717
In this tour, you'll see
how B1 Admin is laid out,

2
00:00:02.717 --> 00:00:04.890
so you always know where to find things.

3
00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:08.913
When you sign in at admin.b1.church,
you land on the Dashboard.

4
00:00:09.113 --> 00:00:11.777
The top of the Dashboard
shows this Sunday's service,

5
00:00:11.777 --> 00:00:13.985
along with its order of service.

6
00:00:14.185 --> 00:00:16.032
Next to it, you'll see who is serving,

7
00:00:16.032 --> 00:00:18.965
and how many people are
checked in to each room.

8
00:00:19.165 --> 00:00:22.247
Below that, My Tasks lists the
open tasks assigned to you,

9
00:00:22.247 --> 00:00:26.034
and My Groups gives you quick
links to the groups you're in.

10
00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:29.400
Everything else starts at the
search bar, at the top left.

11
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.547
Click the search bar.

12
00:00:30.547 --> 00:00:33.986
You can also press Control
K, or Command K on a Mac.

13
00:00:34.186 --> 00:00:35.872
It lists every section of B1 Admin.

14
00:00:35.872 --> 00:00:38.687
You'll only see the
sections your role allows.

15
00:00:38.887 --> 00:00:40.595
Click a section to see its pages.

16
00:00:40.595 --> 00:00:44.270
People holds your directory, your
groups, attendance, forms, and notes.

17
00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.267
Click any page to go there.

18
00:00:46.467 --> 00:00:50.736
Donations is for giving, with batches,
funds, and giving statements.

19
00:00:50.936 --> 00:00:54.241
Serving is where you build service
plans, keep your song library,

20
00:00:54.241 --> 00:00:56.366
and track tasks and workflows.

21
00:00:56.566 --> 00:01:00.231
Sermons manages your sermon library
and your live stream times.

22
00:01:00.431 --> 00:01:03.711
Website is your church website
builder, with your pages, a blog,

23
00:01:03.711 --> 00:01:05.489
and your church's look.

24
00:01:05.689 --> 00:01:10.144
Calendars holds your events, your rooms
and resources, and event registrations.

25
00:01:10.344 --> 00:01:12.976
Mobile controls what your
members see in the B1 app.

26
00:01:12.976 --> 00:01:16.563
It's also where you set up B1
Check In and its name labels.

27
00:01:16.763 --> 00:01:21.110
And Settings is where you set up your
church information, roles, email templates,

28
00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:22.193
and more.

29
00:01:22.393 --> 00:01:24.758
You can also skip the
browsing and just type.

30
00:01:24.758 --> 00:01:27.281
Search for a person, a
group, a plan, or a fund,

31
00:01:27.281 --> 00:01:29.773
and click it to jump straight there.

32
00:01:29.973 --> 00:01:31.786
The search bar can start tasks, too.

33
00:01:31.786 --> 00:01:35.356
Type add a person, and you can
add someone right from here.

34
00:01:35.556 --> 00:01:38.721
At the bottom of the list, Quick
Actions has setup shortcuts,

35
00:01:38.721 --> 00:01:41.915
like Set Up Online Giving
and Invite Team Members.

36
00:01:42.115 --> 00:01:45.919
The logo at the top left takes you
back to the Dashboard anytime.

37
00:01:46.119 --> 00:01:50.437
The question mark at the top right opens
help, with links to the documentation,

38
00:01:50.437 --> 00:01:52.896
ChurchApps support, and the forum.

39
00:01:53.096 --> 00:01:57.232
Click the arrow next to your profile
picture for your messages, notifications,

40
00:01:57.232 --> 00:01:57.868
and profile.

41
00:01:57.868 --> 00:02:00.801
You can also choose
light or dark mode here.

42
00:02:01.001 --> 00:02:04.269
Switch App takes you to the
other ChurchApps tools you use,

43
00:02:04.269 --> 00:02:07.638
like the B1.church member
site and Lessons.church.

44
00:02:07.838 --> 00:02:08.575
Here's a tip.

45
00:02:08.575 --> 00:02:13.825
From anywhere in B1 Admin, press the slash
key, and the search bar opens right up.

46
00:02:14.025 --> 00:02:16.557
Next, take a tour of the
B1.church member app.

47
00:02:16.557 --> 00:02:21.452
And for step by step help with anything
in B1, head to support.churchapps.org.
